56:04.860 --> 56:06.300
Quelle foi

56:06.300 --> 56:06.860
manifeste

56:06.860 --> 56:07.420
le plus

56:07.420 --> 56:08.320
la gloire

56:08.320 --> 56:10.000
de notre Seigneur ?

56:10.000 --> 56:10.500
La force

56:10.500 --> 56:12.340
